SpecGuard
This product's review rubric and posting logic are adapted from the following projects.

Rubric adapted from:
- anthropics/claude-plugins-official: pr-review-toolkit (pr-test-analyzer, code-reviewer) and the code-review plugin. Apache-2.0.
- github/awesome-copilot: skills/test-gap-audit. MIT.
- obra/superpowers: writing-good-tests. MIT.
- The-PR-Agent/pr-agent: needs-human status for acceptance criteria. MIT.
- mattpocock/skills: tdd (with tests.md and mocking.md) and code-review, adapted for the weak-test catalogue, mocking rule, seams and spec sources. MIT.
- DietrichGebert/ponytail: ponytail-review, adapted for the terse finding style and smallest-test rule. MIT.

Approach adapted from:
- anthropics/claude-code-action: base-branch config restore list, input sanitizing and secret redaction. MIT.
- reviewdog/reviewdog and github/gh-aw: fingerprint dedupe, review posting fallbacks. MIT.

